paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-name
Name: open. The word track is dropped because it does not
describe the thing. It needs a universal word for any repeated or
guided doing: a routine, a lesson, a test, a plan. Candidates are
voted in set 2. Until then this page says track.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-mark-form
Marks. What: a mark is a declaration on any block, for example
mark: rule. Why: the text and the style stay untouched, and the
index can read the mark as data. Drawn: inside the line of the
block, on the right side, always visible, in reading mode and in
writing mode.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-mark-many
Several marks. A block may carry any number of marks and all stay
visible. One mark sits on the right of the first line. Several
marks sit on the bottom line of the block, inside it. Example: a
block marked rule, step and card shows all three at the bottom.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-mark-scope
What can be marked: a file, a chapter, any block type and a whole
directory. Chapter and block marks are declarations. File and
directory marks are made in layout files, which list the files or
directories they mark. Why: a layout already groups files. This
part needs its own planning.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-link
One rule for everything: linked, never copied. A mark, a step and
a chain point at the original through the linking system. Why: one
edit at the source reaches every place that uses it. When the
source is renamed the server rewrites every link at once, so
nothing breaks and no manual fix exists.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-where
Where the files live: open. He leans to the notation assets folder
(option D), but assets are shared and these are user data, and the
one place rule says every notation asset lives in notation/. This
needs more thinking and is asked again in set 2.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-steps
Steps. A step has a title and a description of its own and a link
to the original block, so one key opens the original file. Why: you
may forget the details and must be able to read the source without
losing your place. Timers, pauses and repeats inside a step are
planned in their own chapter.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-levels
Levels are numbers. A level is raised or lowered by hand: by him,
or by the AI when he asks. There is no automatic rule. Why: a level
is a decision about the person, not a count.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-order
Order. No step is missed or dropped. Steps stay in one straight
chronological line. Why: that order is the point of the feature.
Skip and snooze exist, but they are actions he takes, recorded in
the step, never silent.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-time
Time model: unlimited. Fixed clock, relative to the last step,
sun based, month, year and decade based, and any later kind. Each
kind is added without changing the others. Example: every hour at
:00 and also 45 minutes after the last done, in one track.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-progress
Progress lives in the step itself, in the file of the track, for
every kind of use: checklist, routine, spaced repetition, forced
recurrent repetition. A step can progress and regress. The
original block is never changed.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-commit
Saving progress. While a chain runs, progress stays live and is
not committed. It is committed only when the whole chain ends or
is stopped, never on pause and never on a tap. Progress commits go
on their own git branch. Why: a clean history of the book.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-surfaces
Where it shows: the server, the shell, the multiplexer at start
and a new box in his own dashboard. No phone alerts now. The web
page is the main place for graphics. The editor works on the same
files and both stay in sync. Each track also has a page, a file.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-walk
The walk is modular, with parts combined and changed live. Pause
stops the timer without stopping the chain. He can jump to the
original block, read, and return to the same place.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-actions
Actions on a step: done, skip, back, pause, snooze, add time,
lower time and swap. Each can be switched on or off. All of it is
editable from the file, from the web page and from a menu in the
settings TUI, and the three stay in sync.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?

answer end
paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-d1-measures
Measures. Any step may count anything: reps, minutes, a timer, a
wait, a pause. One generic measure with a unit, never a fixed
list. Example: 25 push-ups, 30 s rest, 5 min stretch.
