code start
name: code-tp-layers
language: text
M1  marks      mark a file, chapter or block
M2  track      a file of ordered references
M3  progress   a log of what was done and when
M4  time       when a step is due
M5  levels     steps that unlock by level
M6  chains     a track after, inside or beside another
M7  views      checklist, rule list, overview, history
M8  walk       one step at a time, pause, resume
M9  web        layout and web view for tracks
M10 alerts     a reminder at the due time
code end

chapter end

