paragraph start
name: paragraph-tp-file-one
A track is a normal .aiu file of kind track. It has a title, a
goal, a sort (routine, learn, test, care or anything) and then
ordered reference blocks.
contract start
id: q1deb06
question: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
contract end
