paragraph start
name: paragraph-tp-file-ref
A reference block points at a block by its name, the same way
links do, and the index resolves it. Fields: target, level, every,
minutes, note, replaces. Numbering is automatic. The order
changes by moving the reference blocks. The originals are never
touched.
