paragraph start
name: paragraph-tp-order-first
First usable day: M1, M2, M3 and the checklist from M7. That
gives marks, a track file, a log and a list of what to do. Then
M4 time, M5 levels, M6 chains, M8 walk, M9 web, M10 alerts.
