paragraph start
name: paragraph-tp-ex-body
Body track: it includes self care and workout at level 1. Each
waking hour: stretch, push-ups, sit-ups, drink water, wet wipe.
Level 2 replaces ten push-ups with twenty and adds neck work. On
a bad day the walk drops one level for that day only.
